    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Chemist 6</p><p>When the chemist creates a bomb, he can choose to have it dispel magic effects instead of deal damage. Creatures that take a direct hit from a dispelling bomb are subject to a targeted dispel spell, using the chemist's level as the caster level. This cannot be used to target a specific spell effect.</p><p><em>* This discovery modifies bombs. Discoveries marked with an asterisk do not stack; only one such discovery can be applied to an individual bomb.</em></p>",
